     1|/**
     2| * IVX AUTONOMOUS QA SCHEDULER — continuous in-process QA (W9).
     3| *
     4| * Mandated cadence (AUTOMATIC QA):
     5| *   - Health check          every 5 minutes
     6| *   - Authentication API    every 15 minutes
     7| *   - Protected routes      every 15 minutes (part of the auth probe set)
     8| *   - Full auth matrix      every 2 hours
     9| *
    10| * Runs inside the long-lived Render service process. Results persist to the
    11| * durable store; incidents open/close through the shared Owner Auth Guardian
    12| * state, so the guardian, the dashboard and this scheduler share one incident
    13| * ledger. When a NEW incident opens and the SMS provider is runtime-ready,
    14| * an owner SMS alert in the mandated IVX ALERT format is attempted and logged.
    15| *
    16| * Route (registered in backend/hono-extended.ts):
    17| *   GET /api/ivx/autonomous/qa — owner-only scheduler status + recent runs
    18| *
    19| * Marker: ivx-auth-qa-scheduler-2026-07-17
